 "note": "Primeira Liga 2026-27 has 18 clubs; only 10 were confirmed by name this session (Porto as defending champions; Benfica, Braga, Casa Pia, Estoril Praia, Estrela da Amadora, Arouca, Alverca continuing from 2025-26; Académico de Viseu and Marítimo promoted from Liga Portugal 2). AVS and Tondela were named as relegated OUT of the Primeira Liga into Liga Portugal 2 for 2026-27, so they are listed under the tier-2 entry instead. Liga Portugal 2 has 18 clubs; 10 were confirmed by name this session (Tondela, AVS, Amarante, Académica de Coimbra, Feirense, Penafiel, Vizela, União de Leiria, and reserve sides Benfica B and Porto B, from fixture and promotion/relegation reporting); the remaining ~8 clubs (including Torreense, which appeared in a fixture list but could not be confirmed as a first-team Liga Portugal 2 participant with certainty) were not confirmed within the search budget. Both leagues marked unverified due to incomplete rosters."
